# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
#
# A screen that keeps moving, so that tearing can be looked at without a finger on it: the home
# screen swiped left and right, back to back, from 120 s into the run, for about eighty seconds.
# The stripes only show while something moves, and the framebuffer copy into the panel's memory
# is what they come from, so this is the screen for judging fb_fetch_align and its successors.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 120 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 350 wait 1 swipe 0.85